WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:17.217 --> 00:00:20.720
Each year at commencement,
our university recognizes an

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:23.089
exceptional group of
individuals with

00:00:23.089 --> 00:00:27.260
honorary degrees. These degrees
are the most significant

00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:29.896
distinction conferred by the
Yale Corporation,

00:00:29.896 --> 00:00:33.066
the university's board
of trustees, to signal

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:37.737
pioneering achievement in a
field or conspicuous and

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:41.107
exemplary contribution to
the common good.

00:00:41.941 --> 00:00:44.310
Though we cannot adorn this
year's honorary degree

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.579
recipients in their
academic hoods

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:48.081
or applaud their
accomplishments

00:00:48.081 --> 00:00:51.284
as they stand on the
commencement stage, we gather

00:00:51.284 --> 00:00:55.722
virtually to recognize their
achievements and we express our

00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:59.025
gratitude for the ways they
have expanded the frontiers of

00:00:59.025 --> 00:01:04.431
knowledge and enriched our
world through science, art,

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.399
innovation and service.

00:01:08.068 --> 00:01:10.804
Today, we honor nine
individuals who serve as

00:01:10.804 --> 00:01:15.275
examples to our graduates and
members of the Yale community.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:19.813
They encourage us to aspire to
excellence and to value those

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:24.584
elements of human character
that they embody.

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:30.056
Creativity, curiosity,
discipline, integrity,

00:01:30.056 --> 00:01:32.892
and a passion
for public service.

00:01:32.892 --> 00:01:36.429
Collectively, they represent
Yale's highest aspirations as a

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:41.501
university dedicated to
"light and truth."

00:01:42.302 --> 00:01:44.971
and their association with the
Class of 2021

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:48.641
honors the students
who graduate today.

00:01:49.709 --> 00:01:53.847
Now, it is my distinct pleasure
to announce the

00:01:53.847 --> 00:02:00.820
2021 honorary degree recipients
and to confer their degrees.

00:02:01.688 --> 00:02:04.958 align:end position:100% line:76%
For the degree of
Doctor of Fine Arts,

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:08.862 align:start size:72% position:28% line:78%
Ava DuVernay, filmmaker

00:02:09.696 --> 00:02:13.666 align:end position:100% line:76%
Creator and critic, you portray
the richness and variety of

00:02:13.666 --> 00:02:16.569 align:start size:50% position:50% line:76%
human experience
from all angles.

00:02:16.569 --> 00:02:20.106 align:end position:100% line:76%
By elevating others, you bring
new stories into focus

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:23.143 align:end position:100% line:76%
and amplify voices we
need to hear.

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:26.846
Hollywood maverick,
for challenging us to

00:02:26.846 --> 00:02:29.649
reckon with our past and our
present and for working to

00:02:29.649 --> 00:02:32.819
change both an
industry and society.

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:36.055
Yale is pleased to
confer on you

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:39.058
this Doctor of Fine Arts
degree.

00:02:39.993 --> 00:02:42.962 align:end position:100% line:76%
For the degree of
Doctor of Social Science,

00:02:42.962 --> 00:02:47.000 align:start size:63% position:38% line:76%
Daniel Todd Gilbert,
social psychologist.

00:02:47.000 --> 00:02:50.870 align:end position:100% line:76%
Fearless investigator,
generous teacher, you connect

00:02:50.870 --> 00:02:55.642 align:end position:100% line:76%
the laboratory to our lives,
applying the fruits of research

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:58.711 size:88% position:56% line:78%
to our search for happiness.

00:02:58.711 --> 00:03:02.115 align:end position:100% line:76%
With humor and understanding,
you explore memory,

00:03:02.115 --> 00:03:06.085 align:end position:100% line:76%
imagination and emotion,
helping us look more clearly to

00:03:06.085 --> 00:03:10.056
the future. For stumbling on
answers to life's great

00:03:10.056 --> 00:03:14.827
questions and sharing them
widely, Yale is happy to award

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:20.333
you the degree of
Doctor of Social Science.

00:03:21.267 --> 00:03:24.070 align:start position:0% line:76%
For the degree of
Doctor of Laws,

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:28.908 align:start position:0% line:76%
Dolores C. Huerta,
community organizer.

00:03:28.908 --> 00:03:30.843 align:start position:0% line:76%
From the fields to the
statehouse

00:03:30.843 --> 00:03:34.247 align:start position:0% line:76%
you have united people
in pursuit of justice.

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:37.717 align:start position:0% line:68%
Your skills as an organizer are
matched by the strength of

00:03:37.717 --> 00:03:42.188 line:68%
your convictions: that there is
dignity in labor, that rights

00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:45.391 align:start position:0% line:76%
are worth fighting for,
and that people power is the

00:03:45.391 --> 00:03:48.161 size:78% position:39% line:78%
strongest force on earth.

00:03:48.161 --> 00:03:52.699
Courageous advocate for showing
us that, yes, we can

00:03:52.699 --> 00:03:54.267
change the world.

00:03:54.267 --> 00:03:57.036
We are honored to present you
with this

00:03:57.036 --> 00:04:00.673
Doctor of Laws degree.

00:04:01.207 --> 00:04:03.343 align:end position:100% line:76%
For the degree
of Doctor of Humanities,

00:04:03.343 --> 00:04:08.014 align:end position:100% line:76%
Robert Farris Thompson,
art historian.

00:04:08.014 --> 00:04:12.051 align:end position:100% line:76%
Scholar of improvisation,
connoisseur of cool,

00:04:12.051 --> 00:04:13.920 align:end position:100% line:76%
your work
celebrates the sights,

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:16.055 align:end position:100% line:76%
sounds, and towering
achievements of

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:21.160 align:end position:100% line:76%
the Black Atlantic. With
joyful curiosity, you explore

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:23.830 align:end position:100% line:76%
the flash of
the spirit while mentoring

00:04:23.830 --> 00:04:26.499 align:start size:75% position:25% line:78%
generations of students.

00:04:26.499 --> 00:04:30.103
Professor of mambo,
Beloved "T":

00:04:30.103 --> 00:04:33.473
for contributing so much to the
rhythm of our lives,

00:04:33.473 --> 00:04:37.710
Yale is privilege to present
you, one of our own, with your

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:42.915
fourth Yale degree,
Doctor of Humanities.

00:04:43.683 --> 00:04:46.252 align:end position:100% line:76%
For the degree of
Doctor of Medical Sciences,

00:04:46.252 --> 00:04:51.090 align:end position:100% line:76%
Donald R. Hopkins,
physician and epidemiologist.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:54.327 align:end position:100% line:76%
Courageous and brilliant,
warrior against disease,

00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:56.396 align:end position:100% line:76%
you have slain the
"fiery serpent"

00:04:56.396 --> 00:04:59.232 align:end position:100% line:76%
and subdued
"the greatest killer".

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:01.034 line:78%
From Atlanta to Sierra Leone,

00:05:01.034 --> 00:05:04.137 align:end position:100% line:76%
and bedsides
around the globe,

00:05:04.137 --> 00:05:08.741 line:76%
you purged ancient plagues and
delivered healing to millions.

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:11.311
In appreciation of
your dogged determination

00:05:11.311 --> 00:05:13.446
and life-saving compassion,

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:15.715
We humbly bestow on you

00:05:15.715 --> 00:05:21.054
the degree of
Doctor of Medical Sciences.

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:24.390 align:end position:100% line:76%
For the degree of
Doctor of Humane Letters,

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:28.461 align:end position:100% line:76%
Stephen Colbert,
writer and comedian,

00:05:28.461 --> 00:05:32.699 align:end position:100% line:76%
Modern day jester, your satires
and set-ups have shaped our

00:05:32.699 --> 00:05:35.034 align:start size:78% position:22% line:78%
culture and our politics.

00:05:35.034 --> 00:05:38.938 line:76%
Whether playing a character,
playing it straight, or having

00:05:38.938 --> 00:05:42.909 align:end position:100% line:76%
it both ways, you take us
beyond truthiness and turn our

00:05:42.909 --> 00:05:45.445 size:84% position:58% line:78%
attention to urgent issues.

00:05:45.445 --> 00:05:49.515
Award winning-wit, for using
your creativity, talent, and

00:05:49.515 --> 00:05:53.319
craft to engage us
in the work of democracy,

00:05:53.319 --> 00:05:55.788
we are delighted to
confer on you this

00:05:55.788 --> 00:05:58.991
Doctor of Humane Letters degree.

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:01.728 align:end position:100% line:76%
For the degree of
Doctor of Letters,

00:06:01.728 --> 00:06:04.931 align:start size:59% position:41% line:78%
Judy Blume, author.

00:06:04.931 --> 00:06:09.135 line:76%
Gifted storyteller, nothing is
off limits and no taboo is too

00:06:09.135 --> 00:06:12.438 align:end position:100% line:76%
great for your uncensored
and honest voice.

00:06:12.438 --> 00:06:16.008 align:end position:100% line:76%
Treasured by readers young and
old, you pushed past

00:06:16.008 --> 00:06:20.012 align:end position:100% line:76%
shame and convention to help us
understand the world and our

00:06:20.012 --> 00:06:24.183
place in it. For championing the
freedom to imagine,

00:06:24.183 --> 00:06:26.919
while encouraging us
to love ourselves,

00:06:26.919 --> 00:06:29.889
Yale is forever proud to
award you this

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:33.259
Doctor of Letters degree.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:36.295 align:start position:0% line:76%
For the degree of
Doctor of Science,

00:06:36.295 --> 00:06:41.634 align:start position:0% line:76%
Nergis Mavalvala,
astrophysicist.

00:06:41.634 --> 00:06:46.038 align:start position:0% line:76%
Intrepid explorer,
inspiring role model, your work

00:06:46.038 --> 00:06:50.309 align:start position:0% line:76%
shifts paradigms and opens new
windows onto the universe.

00:06:50.309 --> 00:06:52.111 line:78%
With precision and originality,

00:06:52.111 --> 00:06:55.348 line:76%
you have devised instruments
that will detect ripples in the

00:06:55.348 --> 00:06:59.819 align:start position:0% line:76%
vast expanse of space
and time, raising ever larger

00:06:59.819 --> 00:07:03.623 align:start position:0% line:76%
questions about the enigmas of
the cosmos.

00:07:03.623 --> 00:07:06.225
In recognition of
your stellar discoveries,

00:07:06.225 --> 00:07:08.728
we gratefully present you

00:07:08.728 --> 00:07:13.266
with the degree of
Doctor of Science.

00:07:14.033 --> 00:07:16.202 align:end position:100% line:76%
For the degree of
Doctor of Divinity,

00:07:16.202 --> 00:07:20.506 align:end position:100% line:76%
Rabbi Lord Jonathan Sacks,
religious leader.

00:07:20.506 --> 00:07:22.475 align:end position:100% line:76%
Championing
dialogue over division

00:07:22.475 --> 00:07:26.179 align:end position:100% line:76%
Rabbi Lord Jonathan Sacks
called us to work together to

00:07:26.179 --> 00:07:30.583 align:end position:100% line:76%
fulfill our responsibilities
and heal the world.

00:07:30.583 --> 00:07:34.720 align:end position:100% line:76%
A respected scholar,
esteemed teacher of Torah,

00:07:34.720 --> 00:07:38.458 align:end position:100% line:76%
and a light unto the nations, he
dedicated his life to

00:07:38.458 --> 00:07:45.031 line:76%
serving others, showing us what
it means to put "we" before "I."

00:07:45.031 --> 00:07:48.935 line:76%
In recognition of his wise and
steadfast moral leadership,

00:07:48.935 --> 00:07:53.005 align:end position:100% line:76%
Yale is honored to confer this
Doctor of Divinity degree

00:07:53.005 --> 00:07:58.945
posthumously on
Rabbi Lord Jonathan Sacks.

00:07:58.945 --> 00:08:03.049
Zecher tzadik livracha.

00:08:04.016 --> 00:08:07.753
On behalf of the Yale community,
I send my most heartfelt

00:08:07.753 --> 00:08:12.658
congratulations to all of you.
The entire university joins me

00:08:12.658 --> 00:08:15.595
in applauding your
accomplishments,

00:08:15.595 --> 00:08:20.700
and welcome to the
Class of 2021!

